WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.350
Finite lattice representation fails.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:05.360
Is every finite lattice the congruence lattice

3
00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:07.819
of a finite algebra? Open for decades.

4
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:11.388
A colouring test on graphs characterizes these

5
00:00:11.388 --> 00:00:13.521
lattices, and one lattice fails it.

6
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.546
Claimed: no, and it is undecidable.

7
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:19.184
Lean checks only part.
